  },
  {
   "id": 214,
   "en": "???",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 215,
   "en": "India - Outskirts of Delhi",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 216,
   "en": "Steel Dragons",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 217,
   "en": "Aboard the Hagane",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 218,
   "en": "Hey, did you see 'em? Those aliens?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 219,
   "en": "Yeah, as they were leaving the hangar.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 220,
   "en": "They were human, same as us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 221,
   "en": "I went to Rabulpaila,@so I already knew, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 222,
   "en": "If folks like that were mixed in with us,@you'd never be able to tell.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 223,
   "en": "Yeah... Same with the <Shura> and the <Zovorg>.@You can't tell they're aliens just by looking.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 224,
   "en": "Old sci-fi movies were full of aliens@who looked nothing like humans, though.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 225,
   "en": "<Endless Frontier>'s got beastmen, ogres,@demons, fairies... A gorgeous lineup,@wouldn't you say?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 226,
   "en": "Yeah, that's right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 227,
   "en": "If anything, the <Steel Dragons> have folks@who look human but are something else inside.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 228,
   "en": "Aschen",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Ah, you mean the green one@with the useless boobage.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "Uh, that goes for you too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Roa too, in a way. But why are there@so damn many aliens out there@that look just like Earthlings?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "It might be the result of convergent evolution.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "Convergent evolution?@What the heck's that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "It's the theory that unrelated species evolving@in similar environments end up with@similar shapes and organs.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "So... meaning what?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "That intelligent life that evolves on planets@like Earth ends up looking much the same,@I'd wager.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Exactly. It's also possible that humanoid@intelligent species share the same roots.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "That's crazy. Isn't the Zovorg homeworld@really far from Earth? And the Shura@came from another world...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "The existence of <Gan Eden> and the <Cross Gate>@may support the theory of a common origin.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "If that's so, then where on earth@do we come from, I wonder...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Hagane - Briefing Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "So Herluga Isberga has seized complete@control of <Rabulpaila>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "What happened to Chief Malum Quisude?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "Heart trouble. He collapsed, they say.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Fairy",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "That can't be... I'm sure he was under stress,@but His Excellency had no heart condition...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Fairy, you said before that His Excellency@was the picture of health.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Judging from what you've told us,@Herluga was already in league with the Golaikunru@before we went to Rabulpaila.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Yes, most likely.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "So the <Zovorg> units that attacked us on@<Rabulpaila> did belong to the Golaikunru...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "A camouflage to keep their ties@to Herluga from being noticed.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "Lieutenant Yon, what kind of person@is this Gomoudokka Golaikunru@who contacted the Gadisword?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Well... we have no data on him. Given the name@Golaikunru, I think he's very likely related@to the company's owners...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "I only saw him giving a speech on Rabulpaila,@but he looked about my age.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "Then he's young.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Herluga said that with materials and technology@from the Golaikunru, Rabulpaila's propulsion@and space transfer device could be repaired.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "War merchants would never do that for free.@Their payment must be the Gadisword's@weapons or military technology.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Do you two have any idea?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Dunno what <Rattma>'s experimental unit@is cooking up on the sly... but it's probably@the Zemon Mortar, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "What's that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "That huge cannon mounted on Rabulpaila's tip.@You all saw it, didn't you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "What kind of energy does it use,@and how powerful is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Beats me.@The Zemon Mortar section's under heavy guard.@I've never been inside.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "It seems it was fired once after@we arrived at Rabulpaila, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "We don't know what it was aimed at,@or what the result was.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Even though a cannon that huge was fired?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Yeah. Until Rabulpaila transferred to this system,@we <Anex> were locked up in the central section.@So we had no idea what was going on outside.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "Fairy... is that true for you as well?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "...Yes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Rabulpaila itself is one big secret...@All we low-ranking soldiers were told is that@it's a space fortress that can move on its own.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "It ain't just the Zemon Mortar.@There's lots of sections@we're forbidden to enter.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "That's only natural for a fortress@full of military secrets, I'd think.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "...My brother most likely stumbled onto it@and was killed to keep him quiet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Huh...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Wait, Fio died in an accident...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Yes, officially.@But the truth is different... I believe.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "What do you mean?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "When the accident happened, there were three@inspectors, Fio included, and fifteen operators@in Rabulpaila's central control room...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "But in fact, Herluga and Reggiane@were there too. I found solid proof@through my own investigation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "No way... The central control room, if I recall...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "It was announced that everyone there had died.@But my brother's and the others' remains@had already been disposed of before that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "That made me suspicious, so I started@looking into the truth. And I learned it seemed@to be connected to the Zemon Mortar somehow.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Connected? How?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "It's highly likely my brother and the others@were killed right after it was fired...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "The Zemon Mortar caused something serious,@and my brother and the others who saw it were@killed to keep them quiet. That's my guess.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Something serious...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Unfortunately, I never found the answer...@but I did find a piece of it. The Siebe Drive.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "The Drift Wing's black box.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Yes.@The Ariard is a test machine for the Siebe Drive.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Do you know what it really is?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "No... All I know is that the Siebe Drive,@like the Zemon Mortar, is one of the keys@to Herluga's plan...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "And that the Golaikunru have their eye on it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "On what grounds?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "After contacting the Golaikunru, Herluga had@the Ariard taken to the Earth Sphere on their ship...@intending to run some kind of test.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "So the Gadisword came to Earth@before peace talks with us...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "So I infiltrated the Golaikunru ship,@and after it reached the Earth Sphere,@I stole the Ariard.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "As Lieutenant Saika said...@you seem to have had special training.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Isn't the same true of you... and her?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Fairy Klibia.@Why did you steal the Ariard?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "To expose Herluga Isberga's conspiracy,@and achieve peace with the people of Earth,@as Chief Malum Quisude wished...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "So that one day, we can return@to our mother planet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Then you should've just come@and talked to us about it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Exactly. Look how things turned out anyway.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "I couldn't let you suffer the same fate@as Fio. I also wanted to keep His Excellency@from being dragged into it, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "The Ariard was pursued and crashed on Earth...@and I lost my memory. That's why I was late@telling Earth about Herluga's scheme.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "(If the Earth government had known about Herluga@and the Golaikunru before the peace talks,@what would they have decided?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "(Captain Vort said he didn't know@why Fairy deserted...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "(But the Captain lied to us.@I can't tell if what he said about Fairy@is true either...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Now, Sieg Altolied, Sally Emil.@Tell us why you came to us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "I wanted to know the truth too.@I figured Fairy and the Ariard were the key@to unraveling Herluga's conspiracy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "In the end, I still don't know what matters...@but I get the feeling it's easier to get to@the bottom of this from outside than inside.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "I... If exposing Herluga's conspiracy means@we don't have to go to war with Earth's forces,@nothing could be better.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "We feel the same.@We want to avoid conflict with the Gadisword@as much as possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "I'll pass on the wishes of you three...@but until your treatment is decided, you'll stay@in private cabins under close watch.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "After all, we can't rule out that you're spies@posing as deserters.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "(Hmph. Suspicious bastard.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "(...Given how this came about, it can't be helped.@I wonder what Akimi and Akemi think of me...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "Meeting only over a monitor was fishy...@I knew something was going on.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "No kidding.@Calling her the Soul Saber's dedicated mechanic@and all that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Jinpu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "It was top-secret stuff, so what could I do?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Still, even being told Fairy's an alien,@it doesn't feel strange somehow.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Me neither...@It felt like she was an Earthling@we'd known for ages.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Well, if you two feel that way,@maybe peace with the Gadisword@will work out after all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "So, why'd you call us here?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Oh, right, I got word from Mogami's head office.@The Saber Booster's gonna be done@the day after tomorrow.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Seriously?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Isn't that a little ahead of schedule?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "That's thanks to all the staff working hard.@Sounds like the president's been cracking@the whip too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Dad did...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "It won't make the next big operation, but I'll@set it up to reach Aviano sometime after that.@Don't you go breaking the Soul Saber till then.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Yeah, got it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Hagane - Commander's Office",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "...Now, I'll go over our unit's course of action@going forward, based on the General Staff's decision.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "First, the Hagane will take part in Operation@Triumph, the Southern Europe Army's operation@to liberate Paris.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Its main task is a diversion by the SRX and PTX@Teams' units equipped with T-Link Systems.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Before that, you'll resupply at Aviano Base,@where the Gadisword will disembark.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "The liberation of Paris is the Federation Army's@top strategic priority, but we can't leave@the Lamaris elsewhere unchecked either.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "So the Hiryu Custom will act separately. First head@to Hindan Base, resupply there, and then proceed@to Karachi in the Pakistan region.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "The evacuation of its residents is complete,@but it's now the place where the most@Lamaris have gathered.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "Suppress the Lamaris with the ATX Team and Octo@Squad's units, plus the Sympathia-equipped units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Also, Lieutenant Calvina of the PTX Team will be@assigned to the Hiryu Custom along with@Touya Shiun. You know why.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Because their machines@are the Fury's targets.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "Exactly. We want to avoid them barging in and@throwing Operation Triumph into chaos...@That's the Joint Chiefs of Staff's decision.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "By making these operations succeed, we must end@the worldwide chaos caused by the Lamaris.@I expect every one of you to do your utmost.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}